                                                         rdfs:domain :PowerTransformer ;
                                                         rdfs:range :Voltage ;
                                                         rdfs:comment "The highest operating voltage Ub in IEC 609090 before short circuit. It is used for calculation of the impedance correction factor KT defined in IEC 609090. This is worst case voltage on the low side winding 3.7.1 of IEC 609092001. Used to define operating conditions." ;
                                                         rdfs:label "beforeShCircuitHighestOperatingVoltage"@en ,
                                                                    "{4E3E92DC-A260-4f23-87CC-E569FF4567A7}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PowerTransformer.beforeShortCircuitAnglePf
