                                          rdfs:comment "If True the value indicates that the entity represented by the bilateral table is capable of issuing requests and responding to request e.g. bidirectional support of ICCP requests.If False this indicates that a calling entity e.g. calling  True will not be able to respond to ICCP requests.  If False and callingFalse this indicates that the entity will only respond to ICCP requests and not issue ICCP requests." ;
