               rdfs:subClassOf :IdentifiedObject ;
               rdfs:comment "Used to apply user standard names to TopologicalNodes. Associated with one or more terminals that are normally connected with the bus name.    The associated terminals are normally connected by nonretained switches. For a ring bus station configuration all BusbarSection terminals in the ring are typically associated.   For a breaker and a half scheme both BusbarSections would normally be associated.  For a ring bus all BusbarSections would normally be associated.  For a straight busbar configuration normally only the main terminal at the BusbarSection would be associated.  " ;
               rdfs:label "BusNameMarker"@en ,
                          "{CC2E7414-F646-406e-BFE1-86C1E97305FA}"@guid .


