###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#CrossCompoundTurbineGovernorDynamics
:CrossCompoundTurbineGovernorDynamics rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                      rdfs:subClassOf :DynamicsFunctionBlock ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Turbinegovernor crosscompound function block whose behaviour is described by reference to a standard model font color0f0f0for by definition of a userdefined model.font" ;
