:GovCT1 rdf:type owl:Class ;
        rdfs:subClassOf :TurbineGovernorDynamics ;
        rdfs:comment "General model for any prime mover with a PID governor used primarily for combustion turbine and combined cycle units.This model can be used to represent a variety of prime movers controlled by PID governors.  It is suitable for example for the representation of ulligas turbine and single shaft combined cycle turbinesliulullidiesel engines with modern electronic or digital governors  liulullisteam turbines where steam is supplied from a large boiler drum or a large header whose pressure is substantially constant over the period under studylilisimple hydro turbines in dam configurations where the water column length is short and water inertia effects are minimal.liulAdditional information on this model is available in the 2012 IEEE report iuDynamic Models for TurbineGovernors in Power System Studiesui 3.1.2.3 pages 34 GGOV1." ;
        rdfs:label "GovCT1"@en ,
                   "{EC304C29-08AD-426b-BEBF-8167E8655879}"@guid .


