                 rdfs:subClassOf :BaseReading ;
                 rdfs:comment "Data captured at regular intervals of time. Interval data could be captured as incremental data absolute data or relative data. The source for the data is usually a tariff quantity or an engineering quantity. Data is typically captured in timetagged uniform fixedlength intervals of 5 min 10 min 15 min 30 min or 60 min.Note Interval Data is sometimes also called Interval Data Readings IDR." ;
                 rdfs:label "IntervalReading"@en ,
                            "{779A4909-8E4E-4587-B2DB-C60366EAE9F4}"@guid .


