                 rdfs:label "LoadBreakSwitch"@en ,
                            "{D64FF392-C9F8-4220-8861-1944D504F342}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#LoadComposite
:LoadComposite rdf:type owl:Class ;
               rdfs:subClassOf :LoadDynamics ;
               rdfs:comment "Combined static load and induction motor load effects.The dynamics of the motor are simplified by linearizing the induction machine equations." ;
               rdfs:label "LoadComposite"@en ,
                          "{BDFAC440-3B77-47a6-B8DB-C480D393299F}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#LoadDistributionFactor
