                   rdfs:label "ReadingReasonKind"@en ,
                              "{7EE63604-51AF-4e8b-AFD4-6117CB2C7D8A}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ReadingType
:ReadingType rdf:type owl:Class ;
