:TransformerMaintenanceKind rdf:type owl:Class ;
                            rdfs:subClassOf :Enumeration ;
                            rdfs:comment "Kinds of transformer maintenance.BreakerMaintenanceKind enumerationPossible types of breaker maintenance work." ;
                            rdfs:label "TransformerMaintenanceKind"@en ,
                                       "{0671A231-626D-40ac-A402-1F3A48297200}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerMeshImpedance
:TransformerMeshImpedance rdf:type owl:Class ;
                          rdfs:subClassOf :IdentifiedObject ;
                          rdfs:comment "Transformer mesh impedance Deltamodel between transformer ends.The typical case is that this class describes the impedance between two transformer ends pairwise i.e. the cardinalities at both transformer end associations are 1. However in cases where two or more transformer ends are modelled the cardinalities are larger than 1." ;
                          rdfs:label "TransformerMeshImpedance"@en ,
                                     "{49FE2028-1AD5-4550-A55A-FA43C4D07C38}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerObservation
:TransformerObservation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf :IdentifiedObject ;
                        rdfs:comment "Common information captured during transformer inspections andor diagnostics. Note that some properties may be measured through other means and therefore have measurement values in addition to the observed values recorded here." ;
                        rdfs:label "TransformerObservation"@en ,
                                   "{19852455-FDDC-4a91-966A-A3D1676F6F93}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerRepairItemKind
:TransformerRepairItemKind rdf:type owl:Class ;
                           rdfs:subClassOf :Enumeration ;
                           rdfs:comment "Transformer components and problem areas which can be the focus of a repair work task.WorkTimeScheduleKind enumerationKind of work schedule." ;
                           rdfs:label "TransformerRepairItemKind"@en ,
                                      "{00E45113-3606-4c58-87B4-1F73B01DB811}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerStarImpedance
:TransformerStarImpedance rdf:type owl:Class ;
                          rdfs:subClassOf :IdentifiedObject ;
                          rdfs:comment "Transformer star impedance Pimodel that accurately reflects impedance for transformers with 2 or 3 windings. For transformers with 4 or more windings TransformerMeshImpedance class shall be used.For transmission networks use PowerTransformerEnd impedances r r0 x x0 b b0 g and g0." ;
                          rdfs:label "TransformerStarImpedance"@en ,
                                     "{35D1EE00-F393-4e93-A01A-B4E816466033}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerTank
:TransformerTank rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:subClassOf :Equipment ;
                 rdfs:comment "An assembly of two or more coupled windings that transform electrical power between voltage levels. These windings are bound on a common core and placed in the same tank. Transformer tank can be used to model both singlephase and 3phase transformers." ;
                 rdfs:label "TransformerTank"@en ,
                            "{0CAA4373-C2DA-47f6-A18B-9EDC59465FCE}"@guid .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#TransformerTankEnd
:TransformerTankEnd rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf :TransformerEnd ;
                    rdfs:comment "Transformer tank end represents an individual winding for unbalanced models or for transformer tanks connected into a bank and bank is modelled with the PowerTransformer." ;
                    rdfs:label "TransformerTankEnd"@en ,
                               "{7CAE4704-5B8C-4ad5-B3B1-6ECD141F8A09}"@guid .


